rooms_desc ({"You are now in the entrance area to Mork's home.To the north is the Atrium which will lead you to the rest of the estate.","This is the Atrium of Mork's house. It has a glass ceiling so you can enjoy the sunshine or moon and stars.There are several species of exotic plants displayed around the room.To the east is the Observatory. To the west is an egg.To the south is the Entrance.","This is Mork's Observatory. He is very appreciative of the stars!It has a high dome ceiling and marble floors.In the center of the room is a rather large telescope.To the west is the Atrium. To the north is a porch","You have walked out onto a large stone porch that overlooks Cresent Lake.There is soft moonlight surrounding you and Orion is in the west. Feelfree to stay and relax for as long as you like","You are now in and egg. This is the spaceship which brought Mork toHoly Mission. There are several complex components all around you. You think that you had better not touch anything.","This is a room FULL of muscial instruments and components.There are several speakers placed strategiaclly around the room.Mork has a kick ass stereo set up here. You wonder if it could shake the whole MUD down. A tremendous collectionof music is against one very large wall. You can't seem to find anything missing from it at all! This is definately the coolest place in the hohouse!","You have now entered the sauna of Mork's home.There is also a jacuzzi of to the right that looks VERY relaxing.The room is kinda steamy and everything seems like a natural aphrodisiac.Might as well sit back and enjoy the setting.","This is just a room.","This is Mork's Library. He has several nice collections from different authors. He has only recently started his collectionthough so it is still somewhat small.","You step over the edge of a bottomless pit. This take you assomewhat of a suprise. It sure looked like there was a floor!You are endlessly falling which makes you nervous at first.Then you realize how relaxing free falling is. You notice the same room keep passing by to the north as you fall.This is definately a very odd place!",})
rooms_short ({"The Entrance to Mork's house.","The Atrium","The Observatory","The Porch","An Egg","Music room","The sauna","a room","Library","The Pit",})
